# Flow 2 — Tasks page: the task list renders and is non-empty.
#
# Non-empty is asserted by matching the identifier prefix every task row link
# carries ("Open <PREFIX>-N: <title>"). On an instance with no tasks the page
# renders the explicit empty state "No tasks match the current filters or
# search." instead, and this replay fails — the list going empty is a real
# change the harness should surface, not something to paper over.
#
# Runs signed in, in the session left behind by local-auth.ad.

open ${E2E_BASE_URL}/${E2E_COMPANY_PREFIX}/issues
wait text "New Task" 120000
find text "Open ${E2E_COMPANY_PREFIX}-" exists
screenshot clients/expo/replays/evidence/tasks-list-01-task-list.png
